OL,3,AChristina Applegate says she was
OL,4,Awrongly diagnosed with MS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two-part episode, co-hosted by
OL,7,FJamie Sigler, ends a recent break she
OL,8,Ftook to process the information. An
OL,9,Finvestigation into what has been
OL,10,Fcausing her debilitating symptoms -
OL,11,Fwhich she experiences daily - will
OL,12,Fbegin next week.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
